WEBVTT

00:09.900 --> 00:12.150
<b>What do you mean by that?</b>

00:14.150 --> 00:16.120
<b>I don't mean anything else.</b>

00:19.330 --> 00:23.210
<b>I just got sick of something
so miserable as pickpocketing.</b>

00:26.580 --> 00:29.250
<b>I don't like you. You're too cheeky.</b>

00:29.550 --> 00:31.170
<b>This is as good an opportunity as any.</b>

00:31.670 --> 00:35.220
<b>I'll take my time and
show you just who is the master here.</b>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.180
<b>Mm, I worked up a good sweat.</b>

00:39.430 --> 00:41.890
<b>Now I'll go home
and take a nice long bath.</b>

00:42.640 --> 00:46.150
<b>Oh, I wonder if Kenshin
properly drew a bath yet?</b>

00:46.400 --> 00:49.610
<b>He went home before me,
so at least he could do as much.</b>

00:50.230 --> 00:51.070
<b>Hmm?</b>

00:55.110 --> 00:56.110
<b>Wait, that's...</b>

02:27.000 --> 02:31.000
<b>EPISODE 3: KASSHIN-RYU - REBORN</b>

02:33.540 --> 02:36.510
<b>KANTO SHUEI GROUP</b>

02:38.380 --> 02:39.970
<b>Stubborn brat.</b>

02:40.590 --> 02:43.680
<b>All he had to do was make one apology.</b>

02:43.680 --> 02:45.600
<b>Hold up.</b>

02:45.600 --> 02:48.680
<b>Your nickname is Hitokiri Gaskeh.</b>

02:48.680 --> 02:50.730
<b>If you do any more than that,
he'll really die.</b>

02:51.060 --> 02:52.190
<b>Boss...</b>

02:52.650 --> 02:55.610
<b>Yahiko... if you're
gonna quit pickpocketing,</b>

02:55.610 --> 02:57.860
<b>how do you plan to live?</b>

02:58.360 --> 03:01.780
<b>If you think you'll somehow get by
'cause you're a samurai,</b>

03:01.780 --> 03:03.820
<b>you're sorely mistaken.</b>

03:04.370 --> 03:08.290
<b>The Meiji era
is all about cold, hard cash.</b>

03:08.830 --> 03:12.790
<b>Your pride ain't worth a penny,
no matter how much you got of it.</b>

03:13.630 --> 03:18.590
<b>Rather, samurai hold on
to something like that for dear life.</b>

03:18.590 --> 03:21.010
<b>And that's why
they quickly see hard times.</b>

03:23.300 --> 03:26.850
<b>And lately, wives and daughters
of previous daimyos</b>

03:26.850 --> 03:29.230
<b>are all over the red-light district.</b>

03:30.940 --> 03:35.110
<b>Catch a band of thieves, and sometimes
they're all samurai fallen from grace.</b>

03:35.110 --> 03:36.730
<b>How miserable.</b>

03:37.530 --> 03:41.570
<b>Forget that you were born
a samurai, Yahiko...</b>

03:41.990 --> 03:45.120
<b>and learn to live despicably.</b>

03:45.570 --> 03:50.750
<b>That way, I'll keep you around
for a long time as one of my henchmen.</b>

03:53.790 --> 03:55.920
<b>Don't make me say it over and over.</b>

03:55.920 --> 03:57.630
<b>I've had enough.</b>

03:58.340 --> 03:59.800
<b>You little punk!</b>

04:00.300 --> 04:02.260
<b>What an attitude against our boss!</b>

04:02.590 --> 04:06.800
<b>He's the one who saved your life
after your parents croaked!</b>

04:07.300 --> 04:08.220
<b>Yum.</b>

04:08.760 --> 04:10.180
<b>That's enough, already!</b>

04:10.560 --> 04:14.020
<b>You say samurai, but your dad only had
300,000 koku and fed only two people.</b>

04:14.060 --> 04:15.650
<b>He was a poor, stupid vassal!</b>

04:15.650 --> 04:18.440
<b>He stood up against the Imperial Army
early in the revolution</b>

04:18.440 --> 04:20.030
<b>and got slaughtered!</b>

04:20.780 --> 04:23.280
<b>And your mother sold herself
at the red-light district,</b>

04:23.280 --> 04:26.200
<b>then croaked from an illness! What a fool!</b>

04:26.530 --> 04:28.160
<b>I don't know who you're more like,</b>

04:28.160 --> 04:30.700
<b>but this kid definitely comes
from those stupid parents!</b>

04:30.700 --> 04:33.330
<b>Shut up!</b>

04:35.170 --> 04:36.130
<b>Mr. Gaskeh!</b>

04:38.000 --> 04:41.550
<b>Father felt disdain
for going with the flow</b>

04:41.550 --> 04:44.180
<b>and betraying the Shogunate
by siding with the Imperial Army!</b>

04:44.180 --> 04:46.970
<b>That's why he joined the Shogitai
and made a righteous sacrifice!</b>

04:47.720 --> 04:54.020
<b>Mother whittled her life away
working to raise me and fell to illness!</b>

04:55.020 --> 04:58.810
<b>They both had pride and lived noble lives!</b>

04:59.230 --> 05:02.740
<b>I will never allow anyone
to speak badly of them!</b>

05:03.990 --> 05:06.200
<b>I'm the one that won't allow you, brat!</b>

05:07.660 --> 05:09.120
<b>I'll slaughter you!</b>

05:09.870 --> 05:10.910
<b>Huh?</b>

05:15.870 --> 05:17.750
<b>Wh-Who the hell are you?</b>

05:18.000 --> 05:21.090
<b>It's a raid! Everyone get 'im!</b>

05:22.250 --> 05:23.590
<b>Calling for them is useless.</b>

05:24.090 --> 05:26.260
<b>They wouldn't let me in,</b>

05:26.260 --> 05:29.600
<b>so I had everyone outside this room
take a short nap.</b>

05:29.760 --> 05:30.680
<b>Wha...</b>

05:31.180 --> 05:33.140
<b>I am Kenshin Himura, a rurouni.</b>

05:33.970 --> 05:37.100
<b>I have come here for you
to hand the kiddo over to me.</b>

05:37.310 --> 05:39.060
<b>You came here, my ass!</b>

05:39.060 --> 05:40.110
<b>Mr. Gaskeh!</b>

05:40.310 --> 05:41.570
<b>Are you a samurai as well?</b>

05:41.770 --> 05:43.530
<b>I'll round y'all up and kill ya—</b>

05:45.820 --> 05:47.820
<b>I'm in the middle of a conversation.</b>

05:47.820 --> 05:49.870
<b>You stay quiet for a while there.</b>

05:50.280 --> 05:51.330
<b>Mr. Gaskeh!</b>

05:52.120 --> 05:53.540
<b>So how about it, Mr. Boss?</b>

05:54.290 --> 05:57.080
<b>Why don't you show your big heart</b>

05:57.080 --> 06:00.420
<b>and willingly let go of that kiddo,
that you will?</b>

06:03.090 --> 06:04.880
<b>I believe that would be a lot better</b>

06:04.880 --> 06:08.930
<b>than the shame of all your henchmen
being routed coming out into the open.</b>

06:11.220 --> 06:14.010
<b>A-All right.</b>

06:14.010 --> 06:16.140
<b>Take him as you please.</b>

06:16.600 --> 06:17.560
<b>Thank you.</b>

06:17.940 --> 06:19.600
<b>Apologies for asking such a huge favor.</b>

06:20.350 --> 06:22.820
<b>Are you all right, kiddo, that is?</b>

06:23.820 --> 06:25.820
<b>I didn't know where you were.</b>

06:25.820 --> 06:28.570
<b>I'm late because I visited
each and every group.</b>

06:30.030 --> 06:32.240
<b>Who asked you to save me?</b>

06:33.330 --> 06:34.910
<b>I was able to fight on my own!</b>

06:35.410 --> 06:36.450
<b>I could have fought!</b>

06:39.040 --> 06:40.210
<b>I see.</b>

06:40.960 --> 06:44.420
<b>It seems I have underestimated you
yet again, kiddo, that I have.</b>

06:46.130 --> 06:49.090
<b>Then at the least allow me
to treat your wounds</b>

06:49.090 --> 06:50.840
<b>in place of an apology, that I should.</b>

06:53.220 --> 06:54.760
<b>B-Bastard! You ain't getting' away!</b>

06:54.760 --> 06:56.770
<b>Stop it! Don't mess with him!</b>

06:57.850 --> 06:59.730
<b>Those are the eyes of a manslayer.</b>

07:00.640 --> 07:02.560
<b>Not just a Yakuza manslayer...</b>

07:03.190 --> 07:05.190
<b>a real one.</b>

07:07.110 --> 07:12.160
<b>I didn't think someone with those eyes
would be left in these days of Meiji.</b>

07:12.410 --> 07:16.660
<b>You can't have enough lives
going against the likes of those.</b>

07:17.120 --> 07:20.460
<b>It's a great deal if one brat
will let us off the hook.</b>

07:23.330 --> 07:24.380
<b>Damn it.</b>

07:25.790 --> 07:29.010
<b>Damn it. Damn it.</b>

07:29.800 --> 07:33.090
<b>Damn it. Damn it.</b>

07:33.760 --> 07:37.560
<b>Is your lack of strength
that frustrating, kiddo?</b>

07:38.060 --> 07:39.390
<b>Damn it.</b>

07:39.390 --> 07:40.770
<b>I wanna become stronger.</b>

07:42.230 --> 07:44.690
<b>So much that I won't need your help...</b>

07:45.730 --> 07:50.900
<b>so that I can protect the honor
of Father and Mother on my own.</b>

07:54.070 --> 07:57.120
<b>I wanna become stronger</b>

08:01.330 --> 08:03.960
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN
SCHOOL OF KENDO</b>

08:02.160 --> 08:03.460
<b>They're late.</b>

08:04.170 --> 08:07.800
<b>Well, this is Kenshin we're talking about,
so I'm sure he's fine.</b>

08:07.800 --> 08:08.960
<b>But that kid...</b>

08:12.010 --> 08:13.220
<b>I'm home, that I am.</b>

08:14.090 --> 08:15.220
<b>Welcome home.</b>

08:16.100 --> 08:18.010
<b>He's badly hurt, as I expected.</b>

08:18.010 --> 08:19.930
<b>I have a ride waiting
out in the main street,</b>

08:19.930 --> 08:21.310
<b>so we need to hurry to a doctor.</b>

08:21.600 --> 08:25.230
<b>The acting master of Kamiya Kasshin-ryu,
Miss Kaoru Kamiya.</b>

08:27.940 --> 08:30.400
<b>She'll be your instructor from now on,
that she will.</b>

08:31.280 --> 08:32.440
<b>Hold on a sec!</b>

08:32.440 --> 08:34.610
<b>You want me to learn swordsmanship?</b>

08:34.610 --> 08:35.820
<b>From this ugly hag, to boot?</b>

08:35.820 --> 08:38.620
<b>Instructor? You can't mean bringing
this kid in as an apprentice?</b>

08:38.870 --> 08:39.700
<b>Yup!</b>

08:42.450 --> 08:45.330
<b>Now, everything from here
is depending on your own effort.</b>

08:45.790 --> 08:47.750
<b>I took the time
to set everything up for you.</b>

08:48.250 --> 08:51.010
<b>You can become
as strong as you want, Yahiko.</b>

08:52.630 --> 08:53.840
<b>You know what?</b>

08:54.090 --> 08:56.180
<b>You said, "ugly hag" again just now,
didn't you?</b>

08:56.180 --> 08:58.180
<b>Yeah! What of it, ugly hag?</b>

08:58.390 --> 09:01.270
<b>What of it? I told you
that you should stop doing that!</b>

09:00.970 --> 09:01.810
<b>Oro?</b>

09:01.270 --> 09:02.980
<b>- Ugly, ugly, ugly, ugly, ugly hag!
- Huh?!</b>

09:02.020 --> 09:05.020
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

09:05.900 --> 09:08.900
<b>Well, in any case,
first try holding one.</b>

09:08.900 --> 09:09.730
<b>Here.</b>

09:11.820 --> 09:13.440
<b>Huh? What are you doing?</b>

09:13.440 --> 09:16.820
<b>Shut up! I have no idea
why you're bossing me around, ugly hag!</b>

09:16.950 --> 09:19.200
<b>I told you not to call me an ugly hag!</b>

09:19.200 --> 09:20.030
<b>You'll pay for it!</b>

09:20.030 --> 09:22.490
<b>Yeah! Go ahead and try, if you can!</b>

09:22.790 --> 09:23.910
<b>Oro.</b>

09:23.910 --> 09:26.210
<b>Both of them have strong wills,
that they do.</b>

09:26.540 --> 09:28.460
<b>Kenshin, you need to tell him, too!</b>

09:28.460 --> 09:29.840
<b>He has too foul a mouth!</b>

09:30.040 --> 09:33.090
<b>Come, now. He is
your eagerly awaited student, that he is.</b>

09:33.090 --> 09:34.590
<b>You should take better care of him.</b>

09:34.590 --> 09:36.550
<b>Better care, you say?</b>

09:37.220 --> 09:38.510
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN
SCHOOL OF KENDO</b>

09:39.010 --> 09:41.970
<b>One, two, three...</b>

09:41.970 --> 09:44.810
<b>Amazing! There are over 15 here!</b>

09:45.060 --> 09:47.940
<b>The rumors of defeating
the Sword Bearing Police must have spread!</b>

09:48.100 --> 09:50.400
<b>This will let me revive
the Kamiya Kasshin-ryu!</b>

09:51.270 --> 09:52.570
<b>This isn't good.</b>

09:52.570 --> 09:53.400
<b>Huh?</b>

09:53.780 --> 09:58.070
<b>Hey, all of you. I do not practice
the sword style taught here,</b>

09:58.070 --> 10:00.240
<b>and I have no intention
of taking an apprentice.</b>

10:00.240 --> 10:02.580
<b>If you came here
after seeing yesterday's incident...</b>

10:03.240 --> 10:06.120
<b>I'm sorry, but I have to ask you
to leave, that I do.</b>

10:10.330 --> 10:11.290
<b>There we go.</b>

10:13.550 --> 10:14.460
<b>Heh!</b>

10:16.010 --> 10:19.180
<b>If you didn't send everyone back
that day,</b>

10:19.390 --> 10:21.680
<b>I would have endless lessons
to give to students!</b>

10:21.970 --> 10:24.520
<b>Unexpected students who join for curiosity</b>

10:24.520 --> 10:26.930
<b>won't even last six months,
that they don't.</b>

10:27.350 --> 10:28.890
<b>And that wouldn't have any meaning.</b>

10:30.100 --> 10:32.440
<b>More than that, slowly training someone</b>

10:32.440 --> 10:35.190
<b>who really wants to get into it
is better, that it is.</b>

10:36.570 --> 10:39.820
<b>Hey, I came here
so that I could become stronger.</b>

10:39.820 --> 10:42.950
<b>But it's out of the question
if I have to deal with a young girl.</b>

10:42.950 --> 10:43.780
<b>A y—</b>

10:43.780 --> 10:45.540
<b>KAORU KAMIYA</b>

10:43.780 --> 10:45.540
<b>STUDENT</b>

10:43.780 --> 10:45.540
<b>ACTING MASTER</b>

10:44.080 --> 10:46.750
<b>Kenshin, you told me to become stronger.</b>

10:45.540 --> 10:48.040
<b>STUDENT</b>

10:45.540 --> 10:48.040
<b>KAORU KAMIYA</b>

10:46.750 --> 10:49.000
<b>Then teach me your sword instead.</b>

10:48.040 --> 10:49.000
<b>STUDENT</b>

10:49.460 --> 10:51.500
<b>I have no intent
on teaching Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu</b>

10:51.500 --> 10:53.710
<b>to future generations, that I don't.</b>

10:53.710 --> 10:55.750
<b>I am simply a supervisor.</b>

10:56.300 --> 10:58.670
<b>Yahiko, you should learn
Kamiya Kasshin-ryu</b>

10:58.670 --> 11:00.680
<b>and become stronger
with a life-giving sword.</b>

11:01.300 --> 11:02.510
<b>You'll pay for it!</b>

11:02.510 --> 11:03.640
<b>Try me!</b>

11:03.300 --> 11:05.470
<b>Though, they aren't listening,
that they aren't.</b>

11:03.640 --> 11:04.970
<b>Oh, is that okay?</b>

11:04.970 --> 11:06.060
<b>Yeah! Come at me!</b>

11:10.480 --> 11:11.480
<b>Hey!</b>

11:11.480 --> 11:12.440
<b>Stop right there!</b>

11:15.860 --> 11:16.860
<b>Yahiko!</b>

11:17.360 --> 11:18.190
<b>Yahiko!</b>

11:18.650 --> 11:19.860
<b>Yahiko!</b>

11:20.820 --> 11:24.780
<b>Sheesh, the moment I take my eyes off him,
he slacks off.</b>

11:25.280 --> 11:28.330
<b>A foul-mouthed, cynical kid
with no guts whatsoever.</b>

11:28.580 --> 11:30.870
<b>Kenshin, what exactly did you see</b>

11:30.870 --> 11:31.960
<b>in—Him?</b>

11:32.750 --> 11:35.210
<b>I sat quietly, and you
mouth off to your heart's content!</b>

11:35.500 --> 11:38.590
<b>I don't recall ever being
a student of this place!</b>

11:38.590 --> 11:41.680
<b>Compared to being taught by you,
studying on my own is a lot better!</b>

11:42.930 --> 11:45.010
<b>In the first place, all the casuals aside,</b>

11:45.010 --> 11:47.850
<b>now that your false accusation
has been cleared,</b>

11:47.850 --> 11:51.190
<b>why didn't any of your students
return here?</b>

11:52.690 --> 11:53.900
<b>That's because...</b>

11:54.150 --> 11:58.570
<b>Maybe all of them got sick of you
as the acting master?</b>

12:06.240 --> 12:08.240
<b>M-Miss Kaoru!</b>

12:08.950 --> 12:10.290
<b>Pl-Please help!</b>

12:11.250 --> 12:13.420
<b>Hira! And Sato, too!</b>

12:13.920 --> 12:15.250
<b>How'd you get those wounds?</b>

12:15.540 --> 12:16.790
<b>What happened to you?</b>

12:18.800 --> 12:20.550
<b>You can't run anymore!</b>

12:20.550 --> 12:21.760
<b>You're dead meat!</b>

12:22.340 --> 12:23.720
<b>And who exactly are you?</b>

12:24.220 --> 12:26.300
<b>What do you want
with my former students?</b>

12:26.510 --> 12:28.640
<b>Shut up! Don't get in our way!</b>

12:39.110 --> 12:41.320
<b>What exactly is this about?</b>

12:41.320 --> 12:42.860
<b>Can you explain?</b>

12:44.860 --> 12:46.280
<b>Well, um...</b>

12:46.280 --> 12:49.830
<b>we ran across a drunken group of guys
causing a riot in town.</b>

12:49.830 --> 12:53.290
<b>Right. They were causing trouble
to everyone around them,</b>

12:53.290 --> 12:55.080
<b>so we held them down.</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:57.290
<b>Their buddies all came
and resented what we did,</b>

12:57.290 --> 13:00.000
<b>so now they're chasing after us.</b>

13:01.050 --> 13:01.880
<b>Where'd they go?</b>

13:02.210 --> 13:03.300
<b>This way!</b>

13:05.630 --> 13:06.510
<b>Found 'em!</b>

13:06.510 --> 13:09.140
<b>Th-They have so many buddies.</b>

13:09.140 --> 13:10.470
<b>That's too many enemies!</b>

13:10.930 --> 13:12.520
<b>Everyone, go into the dojo!</b>

13:16.020 --> 13:17.020
<b>Damn it!</b>

13:17.020 --> 13:18.150
<b>Mr. Hachisuka!</b>

13:18.480 --> 13:20.440
<b>Heh. Great.</b>

13:20.440 --> 13:21.780
<b>Just great.</b>

13:22.570 --> 13:27.570
<b>Show 'em what it means to make fun
of the Hishimanji Guren Gang!</b>

13:29.120 --> 13:30.410
<b>Now I remember.</b>

13:30.780 --> 13:33.120
<b>That's the Hishimanji Guren Gang.</b>

13:33.580 --> 13:35.080
<b>Hishimanji Guren Gang?</b>

13:35.580 --> 13:38.080
<b>A group of thugs,
like a reserve army of criminals.</b>

13:38.080 --> 13:39.670
<b>Because they don't know their limits,</b>

13:39.670 --> 13:42.090
<b>they're more tenacious and ill-natured
than even Yakuza.</b>

13:42.800 --> 13:44.720
<b>But this is a problem.</b>

13:44.720 --> 13:47.300
<b>Of all times,
they came when Kenshin isn't here.</b>

13:47.510 --> 13:49.890
<b>Wha? I thought I didn't see him.</b>

13:49.890 --> 13:51.260
<b>Where the hell did he go?</b>

13:51.600 --> 13:53.520
<b>I asked him to go shopping.</b>

13:53.520 --> 13:55.940
<b>Rice, salt, miso, and soy sauce.</b>

13:56.390 --> 14:00.270
<b>You idiot. Is there a need
to buy all of that at once?</b>

14:00.270 --> 14:02.360
<b>Wh-What should we do, Miss Kaoru?</b>

14:02.730 --> 14:04.400
<b>Don't "What should we do" us.</b>

14:04.400 --> 14:05.900
<b>This is something you guys started.</b>

14:06.400 --> 14:08.360
<b>It's not their fault.</b>

14:09.030 --> 14:10.780
<b>Are you a genuine idiot?</b>

14:11.370 --> 14:13.700
<b>Are you taking
what they're saying seriously?</b>

14:13.990 --> 14:14.830
<b>Huh?</b>

14:16.410 --> 14:19.250
<b>You two have been reeking of booze
since you came here.</b>

14:19.670 --> 14:22.170
<b>I'm guessing that the guys
who got drunk and caused a riot</b>

14:22.170 --> 14:24.510
<b>were probably you two,
not the Hishimanji guys.</b>

14:24.710 --> 14:26.630
<b>And through drunken momentum,</b>

14:26.630 --> 14:29.010
<b>you picked a fight
against their underlings, right?</b>

14:29.510 --> 14:30.720
<b>Is that so?</b>

14:34.810 --> 14:36.770
<b>Is that really true?</b>

14:38.770 --> 14:40.020
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:45.530 --> 14:48.150
<b>Turtling up is useless
against the Hishimanji!</b>

14:48.450 --> 14:51.870
<b>Come on out, damn it!
I'll crush you, ragtag dojo and all!</b>

14:53.080 --> 14:53.950
<b>A wooden cannon!</b>

14:53.950 --> 14:56.450
<b>He's got something that terrible?</b>

14:57.040 --> 15:01.130
<b><i>Wooden cannon—a simple cannon
used up until the Bakumatsu Era.</i></b>

15:01.630 --> 15:05.670
<b><i>The force of clay balls
shot out of oak-wood barrels</i></b>

15:05.670 --> 15:09.430
<b><i>can hold its own
against normal cannons at close range.</i></b>

15:09.680 --> 15:11.300
<b>Are you surprised?</b>

15:11.300 --> 15:13.720
<b>This is the true power of the Hishimanji!</b>

15:13.720 --> 15:15.680
<b>Just 'cause you learned
a bit of swordsmanship</b>

15:15.680 --> 15:17.520
<b>doesn't mean you can get all stuck-up!</b>

15:17.810 --> 15:21.730
<b>I'll get plenty of revenge
for my buddy that got a broken arm!</b>

15:22.980 --> 15:26.530
<b>You guys swung swords around
in a drunken fight</b>

15:26.530 --> 15:27.940
<b>and injured someone else?</b>

15:29.200 --> 15:32.160
<b>Those guys are idiots
that don't know their bounds,</b>

15:32.160 --> 15:34.410
<b>but these guys
are scum who sunk even lower.</b>

15:34.740 --> 15:37.120
<b>I mean, "former students"
means that they scurried off</b>

15:37.120 --> 15:41.000
<b>during the crossroad killings incident,
right guys?</b>

15:41.250 --> 15:45.040
<b>The fact you're trying to seek refuge
in the dojo is barking up the wrong tree!</b>

15:49.670 --> 15:52.680
<b>You can't run anymore. Come out!</b>

15:53.050 --> 15:54.800
<b>Go ahead and take them.</b>

15:54.800 --> 15:56.850
<b>They got nothin' to do with us anymore.</b>

15:56.850 --> 15:58.140
<b>N-No way.</b>

15:58.430 --> 16:01.440
<b>Moron! You too! That girl over there</b>

16:01.440 --> 16:05.110
<b>is in the same boat
'cause she hid 'em from me.</b>

16:05.440 --> 16:06.820
<b>What was that?</b>

16:06.820 --> 16:09.820
<b>I'll take whatever revenge
you want to deal.</b>

16:11.150 --> 16:13.320
<b>So keep your hands off of these three.</b>

16:14.110 --> 16:16.580
<b>Hold on a sec. What's that about?</b>

16:16.580 --> 16:20.160
<b>My late father and I
taught these two swordsmanship.</b>

16:20.660 --> 16:23.040
<b>Although they no longer study under us,</b>

16:23.040 --> 16:25.790
<b>I do have some responsibility
for their foolish swords.</b>

16:26.790 --> 16:29.170
<b>I thought I was doing my best</b>

16:29.170 --> 16:32.510
<b>to teach the way of a life-giving sword
that can be of use for others...</b>

16:33.550 --> 16:36.260
<b>but I guess it was just wishful thinking.</b>

16:37.930 --> 16:41.100
<b>Yahiko, as long as you feel
that you want to become stronger,</b>

16:41.100 --> 16:42.640
<b>you can improve anywhere you go.</b>

16:43.390 --> 16:44.560
<b>So you should do your best.</b>

16:47.860 --> 16:51.070
<b>You're going to take on
all of their crimes?</b>

16:52.490 --> 16:57.240
<b>Well, it's not bad to face
a martial arts girl every so often.</b>

17:00.120 --> 17:02.710
<b>Gimme a break!</b>

17:03.290 --> 17:07.040
<b>Don't lump me, Yahiko Myojin,
together with these two scumbags!</b>

17:07.540 --> 17:11.670
<b>I can't just let you alone feel
the pain of all this and end it like that!</b>

17:11.670 --> 17:12.880
<b>Mr. Hachisuka!</b>

17:12.880 --> 17:14.720
<b>This brat!</b>

17:14.720 --> 17:17.260
<b>You're not getting away with this!
I'll slaughter you!</b>

17:17.550 --> 17:19.220
<b>Slaughter?</b>

17:19.220 --> 17:20.970
<b>That's far from quaint, that it is.</b>

17:22.270 --> 17:23.680
<b>Kenshin!</b>

17:24.190 --> 17:25.900
<b>I don't know the circumstances,</b>

17:26.560 --> 17:29.110
<b>but no need for you
to pull out the wooden cannon.</b>

17:29.360 --> 17:31.030
<b>Let's stop getting carried away.</b>

17:31.530 --> 17:33.570
<b>Don't act out of stupidity,
that you shouldn't.</b>

17:33.690 --> 17:35.780
<b>Shut up! Who the hell are you?</b>

17:35.780 --> 17:38.160
<b>Mr. Hachisuka, this isn't good.
This guy is—</b>

17:38.160 --> 17:38.990
<b>Huh?</b>

17:39.200 --> 17:41.540
<b>You know that rurouni
who's the talk of the town</b>

17:41.540 --> 17:44.500
<b>after crushing
the Sword Bearing Police by himself?</b>

17:44.500 --> 17:45.920
<b>If I recall, this guy is the one.</b>

17:46.120 --> 17:49.880
<b>Idiot! Why are you cowering
over one simple rurouni?</b>

17:50.040 --> 17:52.340
<b>We have this on our side!</b>

17:52.340 --> 17:54.050
<b>Ready the wooden cannon!</b>

17:54.420 --> 17:55.380
<b>Yeah!</b>

17:56.010 --> 17:56.840
<b>Kenshin!</b>

17:56.840 --> 17:58.430
<b>Fire!</b>

18:09.400 --> 18:14.820
<b>This blade on my sakabato mercilessly
slices apart anything other than humans.</b>

18:15.820 --> 18:17.320
<b>I will say it again.</b>

18:19.030 --> 18:20.370
<b>Stop acting out of stupidity.</b>

18:23.200 --> 18:24.330
<b>Great.</b>

18:25.250 --> 18:26.500
<b>Just great!</b>

18:27.080 --> 18:28.120
<b>Hey, guys!</b>

18:28.120 --> 18:29.750
<b>Y-Yeah?</b>

18:29.750 --> 18:30.580
<b>Let's beat it!</b>

18:33.420 --> 18:38.050
<b>I see. So something like that
had happened while I was out, that it did.</b>

18:38.380 --> 18:39.340
<b>Um...</b>

18:39.340 --> 18:41.890
<b>It's fine. You guys should go home now.</b>

18:42.510 --> 18:46.140
<b>And forget that you
were ever a student here.</b>

18:46.640 --> 18:48.520
<b>And never hold swords in your hands.</b>

18:51.400 --> 18:52.230
<b>Hira.</b>

18:55.440 --> 18:56.780
<b>That wound on your shoulder...</b>

18:57.650 --> 18:59.910
<b>make sure to get it checked out
by a doctor.</b>

19:06.910 --> 19:08.870
<b>STUDENT</b>

19:12.840 --> 19:15.420
<b>Please cheer up, Miss Kaoru.</b>

19:17.920 --> 19:21.090
<b>No matter how hard you try in good faith,</b>

19:21.550 --> 19:24.390
<b>there are times the feelings
don't come across, that it doesn't.</b>

19:26.220 --> 19:29.600
<b>Don't you be sobbing. It's not like you.</b>

19:36.280 --> 19:38.780
<b>I won't end up like those guys.</b>

19:39.530 --> 19:42.030
<b>So I'll be one of your students.</b>

19:43.030 --> 19:46.240
<b>It's impossible for me to immediately
become someone like Kenshin.</b>

19:46.660 --> 19:49.210
<b>So I'll settle
for someone like you for now.</b>

19:52.210 --> 19:54.840
<b>Now let's hurry up
and clean this place up to practice!</b>

19:56.550 --> 19:57.380
<b>However...</b>

19:58.380 --> 20:01.630
<b>there are those that will squarely accept
your good faith, that there are.</b>

20:10.180 --> 20:12.560
<b>There's no time to waste.</b>

20:12.560 --> 20:13.980
<b>Hurry on over, Kaoru!</b>

20:13.980 --> 20:15.810
<b>I wanna become strong real quick!</b>

20:15.810 --> 20:17.780
<b>First it's "ugly hag"!
Now you ditch honorifics?</b>

20:17.780 --> 20:21.780
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN-RYU</b>

20:18.650 --> 20:21.780
<b><i>Kamiya Kasshin-ryu has no master.</i></b>

20:22.360 --> 20:24.740
<b><i>Acting master, Kaoru Kamiya.</i></b>

20:25.160 --> 20:27.700
<b><i>Student, Yahiko Myojin.</i></b>

20:28.040 --> 20:30.910
<b><i>And rurouni, Kenshin Himura.</i></b>

20:31.540 --> 20:34.380
<b><i>One day in early spring
in the 11th year of Meiji,</i></b>

20:34.380 --> 20:38.960
<b><i>a small, new step was definitely taken.</i></b>

22:15.480 --> 22:18.020
<b>All right! We're defeated! You're strong!</b>

22:18.020 --> 22:20.730
<b>Now let us go! We were just frustrated!</b>

22:20.730 --> 22:23.190
<b>No need to say anything. I'm done.</b>

22:23.190 --> 22:25.280
<b>You guys are way too weak.</b>

22:27.360 --> 22:32.330
<b>If I keep going,
it will just end up being bullying.</b>

22:32.830 --> 22:37.540
<b>BAD</b>

22:33.540 --> 22:37.040
<b>Man, I sure got myself
into a really boring fight.</b>

22:38.830 --> 22:42.170
<b>Aren't there any good tough guys
out there somewhere?</b>

22:44.960 --> 22:49.970
<b>NEXT EPISODE
THE FIGHTER FOR HIRE -
SANOSUKE SAGARA</b>

22:45.970 --> 22:49.470
<b><i>Next episode:
The Fighter for Hire - Sanosuke Sagara</i></b>
